  {
    "id": 2004004030190,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "はぁ……はぁ……\r\nおまたせ～……はい！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400403/2004004030190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004030200,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……はい、コンビニのピザまん！\r\nこれも一応、洋食？　やろ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400403/2004004030200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こ、恋鐘……ありがとう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004030210,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "タクシーで食べれるもん、あんまりなかったばってん\r\n……って世間話しとる場合じゃなか！　急いどるんやった！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400403/2004004030210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとな。ほんとに悪いけど……\r\n行ってくる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──オムライス、また行こう",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004030220,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……うん。うちこそ、ありがとね\r\nじゃあ、行ってらっしゃい！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400403/2004004030220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004030230,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "和食か～。なら、丼ものがよか！\r\nしっかり力がつきそうな……かつ丼とか！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400403/2004004030230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは名案かもしれないぞ、恋鐘\r\n確か、この近くに有名な店があるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004030240,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そんなら、決まり！\r\nうち、行ってみたか～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400403/2004004030240"
  },
