  {
    "id": 2004004030250,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "は～……ば～り並んどるね～\r\n待ち時間は……50分！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200400403/2004004030250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004030260,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "テレビで紹介でもされとったんかいな……どうする？\r\nうちはプロデューサーと一緒なら並んでもよかよ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400403/2004004030260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、すまん。並んでるとは思わなくてな……\r\nこの後も仕事が続くから、そこまで時間が取れないんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "丼ものならすぐ食べられるかなって……\r\n店のこと提案しておきながら、ほんとに悪い",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004030270,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そっか～……\r\nそれはしょうがなかたい",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400403/2004004030270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうしようか、\r\nこの辺じゃ、あとは喫茶店くらいしかないけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004030280,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ん～、じゃあ今日はやめといて、\r\nご馳走するのはまた別の日にするたい",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400403/2004004030280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、喫茶店でも軽食くらいあるだろうし……\r\n俺に気を遣って和食にこだわらなくていいんだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004030290,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "も～うちはお礼がしたいって言いよるとよ～\r\nせっかくなんやけん妥協はできんばい～！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400403/2004004030290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そうか……すまん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004030300,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "それにうちもプロデューサーと有名な店に行くの楽しみやし\r\nまた今度、ゆっくり来ようね！　約束ばい！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400403/2004004030300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、約束だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004030310,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "じゃあ、駅まで一緒に行こ～\r\n駅のお蕎麦くらいなら、次の仕事も余裕やろ？",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400403/2004004030310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは嬉しいよ……そうしよう\r\n……なんか今日は頼もしいな、恋鐘",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004030320,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "えへへ……食べることは大事やけんね\r\nプロデューサーもちゃんとしてほしいんよ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400403/2004004030320"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004030330,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "中華か～、色んなもんが食べれるけん、よかね～！\r\n決定～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400403/2004004030330"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうだな\r\n色んな皿を取って、分けて食べようか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004030340,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "え、ええっ……！\r\nう、うちとプロデューサーとで分け合うと……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400403/2004004030340"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……半分になっちゃうのは嫌だったか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004030350,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そ、そげんことなか……！　半分がよかよ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400403/2004004030350"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004004030360,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "何がよかかね！\r\n麻婆豆腐……青椒肉絲……ふかひれのスープに……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400403/2004004030360"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、食べきれなくなっちゃうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
